{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0luZGlhbl9CYW5nbGEvMjAyMC0tQmVmb3JlL1NoYWRvd3MlMjBvZiUyMFRpbWUlMjAlMjgyMDA0JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Shadows of Time","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/kfqLxNPr8bqLmxyA5KEJa21148r.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qzRPocXHTbpaN1GJgrYN2SefNX5.jpg","description":"Ravi and Masha are just children when they were sold into labour by their parents. When they meet, friendship blossoms between them but when the factory manager threatens to sell Masha, possibly into sex slavery, Ravi gives up his hard earned savings to buy her freedom. They agree on a way to find each other once Ravi has earned enough money to buy his freedom but a series of misunderstandings and fear tear them apart. Though they now have their freedom in life, they have to find their way in love.","releaseInfo":"2004","genres":["Drama","Horror","Romance","Bengali"],"imdbRating":"6.2","runtime":"122 min","cast":["Tumpa Das","Sikandar Agarwal","Tannishtha Chatterjee","Prashant Narayanan","Sova Sen","Soumitra Chatterjee","Tillotama Shome","Irrfan Khan"],"director":["Florian Gallenberger"],"released":"2005-11-06T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Time changes everything but love","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Tumpa Das","character":"Masha (young) / Sati"},{"name":"Sikandar Agarwal","character":"Ravi (young)"},{"name":"Tannishtha Chatterjee","character":"Masha (Adult)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sMHI5SS5CSvDLzqwfnGn4XG0oGc.jpg"},{"name":"Prashant Narayanan","character":"Ravi (Adult)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wm0EzbLnwUBgyz0DjQsGWXViXEa.jpg"},{"name":"Sova Sen","character":"Masha (old)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5kIOnEbFSqfEg824221Pz6XEM0a.jpg"},{"name":"Soumitra Chatterjee","character":"Ravi (Old)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pjomXVYzHd62IuduDc9UVS82sBb.jpg"},{"name":"Tillotama Shome","character":"Deepa","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/53kVIXddZaPy6mnKdZZFuOXL